    {
      "id": 540558,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "The E2EE password entropy generated by Rocket.Chat Mobile prior to version 4.5.1 is insufficient, allowing attackers to crack it if they have the appropriate time and resources.\n\nSpecial thanks to Hayato Kimura, Ryoma Ito, Kazuhiko Minematsu, and Takanori Isobe for their research.",
